graph TD
    Start[사용자 요청 수신] --> Analyze[컨텍스트 분석]
    Analyze --> Understand{의도 파악 완료?}
    Understand -->|아니오| AskClarification[명확화 질문]
    AskClarification --> Analyze
    Understand -->|예| CheckPlan{작업 계획 존재?}
    
    CheckPlan -->|아니오| CreatePlan[작업 계획 생성]
    CheckPlan -->|예| EvaluatePlan{계획 수정 필요?}
    
    CreatePlan --> DefineGoal[목표 정의]
    DefineGoal --> BreakdownPhases[단계별 분해]
    BreakdownPhases --> AssignCapabilities[필요 능력 할당]
    AssignCapabilities --> PlanReady[계획 준비 완료]
    
    EvaluatePlan -->|예| UpdatePlan[계획 업데이트]
    EvaluatePlan -->|아니오| PlanReady
    UpdatePlan --> PlanReady
    
    PlanReady --> Think[사고 단계]
    Think --> ConsiderOptions[옵션 고려]
    ConsiderOptions --> EvaluateTools[도구 평가]
    EvaluateTools --> SelectTool[도구 선택]
    
    SelectTool --> Execute[실행]
    Execute --> Observe[결과 관찰]
    
    Observe --> CheckError{오류 발생?}
    CheckError -->|예| DiagnoseError[오류 진단]
    DiagnoseError --> TryCount{시도 횟수 < 3?}
    TryCount -->|예| AlternativeMethod[대안 방법 시도]
    TryCount -->|아니오| RequestHelp[사용자 도움 요청]
    AlternativeMethod --> Execute
    RequestHelp --> End[작업 종료]
    
    CheckError -->|아니오| PhaseComplete{단계 완료?}
    PhaseComplete -->|아니오| Think
    PhaseComplete -->|예| AllPhasesComplete{모든 단계 완료?}
    
    AllPhasesComplete -->|아니오| AdvancePhase[다음 단계로 진행]
    AdvancePhase --> Think
    
    AllPhasesComplete -->|예| PrepareResults[결과물 준비]
    PrepareResults --> DeliverResults[결과 전달]
    DeliverResults --> End
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style End fill:#ffe1e1
    style Think fill:#fff4e1
    style Execute fill:#e1ffe1
    style Observe fill:#f0e1ff
    style DeliverResults fill:#ffe1f0
